---
import { SOCIAL, OPENSTRATA, OPENCOMMUNITY, SOLUNAR } from '../data/site';
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-rule py-8 text-[0.9rem] text-muted">
  <p>
    Andrey Safonov, founder of <a href={SOLUNAR.url}>Solunar</a>, which builds{' '}
    <a href={OPENSTRATA.url}>OpenStrata</a> and <a href={OPENCOMMUNITY.url}>OpenCommunity</a>. Vancouver, British Columbia.
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5">
    <li><a class="inline-block min-h-11 min-w-11 py-2" href={SOCIAL.linkedin} rel="me">LinkedIn</a></li>
    <li><a class="inline-block min-h-11 min-w-11 py-2" href={SOCIAL.github} rel="me">GitHub</a></li>
    <li><a class="inline-block min-h-11 min-w-11 py-2" href={SOCIAL.medium} rel="me">Medium</a></li>
    <li><a class="inline-block min-h-11 min-w-11 py-2" href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a></li>
  </ul>
</footer>
